# Animal Project API — environment variables.
#
# The api is a NestJS scaffold today and currently has no required
# env vars. This file exists so contributors and Vercel project setup
# have a canonical reference for where api-side secrets go in the
# future.
#
# Local dev: copy to apps/api/.env.local (git-ignored).
# Vercel: Project (api) → Settings → Environment Variables.

# Optional. Defaults to 3000 in src/main.ts when running `nx serve api`.
# Vercel ignores this and assigns its own port to the serverless function.
# PORT=3000
